[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932590025","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107046#issuecomment-2932590025","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107046","id":2932590025,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uy8XJ","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T21:34:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T21:34:35Z","body":"✅ I'm 100% behind removing the macros to improve readability.\r\n\r\n❌ IMHO the large `if / else if` chain makes this function huge and harder to follow\r\n❌ Stepping through the function in a debugger is slower when you are trying follow all the messages being parsed\r\n❌ Code size is likely much larger, which we could easily test.\r\n\r\n**This implementation is future proof.** This proposed implementation _is_ less efficient, as you are having to test the string value multiple times – the current implementation is essentially O(1).  If we add a message that is called 100s of times a second (for whatever reason), this function will not scale[^1]. With the existing HashMap, it remains O(1).\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> I had to do this for macOS embedded in another implementation, as it is sending 100s of messages a second for events, etc, so performance is very important. Therefore, I think consistency is good, if we implement all debug handlers with a `HashMap`.\r\n\r\n[^1]: Yes, we could put that message first, but it requires someone has to think about message placement for efficiency.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932590025/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2934686758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107046#issuecomment-2934686758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107046","id":2934686758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6u68Qm","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-03T10:58:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T10:58:04Z","body":"@stuartcarnie thanks for taking the time.\r\n\r\nI think you make a compelling argument to keep the message dispatch via pointer.\r\n\r\nI've updated the PR to only simplify the `ParseMessageFunc` and expand the macros.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2934686758/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2940521548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107046#issuecomment-2940521548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107046","id":2940521548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vRMxM","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-04T15:42:21Z","updated_at":"2025-06-04T15:42:21Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2940521548/reactions","total_c